OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fine sunny day in Cornwall,
OL,6,Fthis becoming more widespread as
OL,7,Fmorning rain and cloud in the east
OL,8,Fgradually pushes away to the north.
OL,9,FBlustery showers push into the far
OL,10,Fsouthwest by evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers give way to more
OL,13,Forganised bands of rain, these pushing
OL,14,Fnorthwestwards through the night.
OL,15,FWinds strengthening to strong
OL,16,Fwesterlies.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
