OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FEarly morning rain pushes
OL,6,Faway to leave scattered showers, these
OL,7,Fheavy at times, and occasional sunny
OL,8,Fspells. Winds continue to strengthen,
OL,9,Freaching gale force along exposed
OL,10,Fcoasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,13,Fcalmer, bright start to Thursday
OL,14,Fbefore turning wet and windy through
OL,15,Fthe afternoon. Blustery showers
OL,16,Fcontinuing Friday, then a brief
OL,17,Fsettled spell likely before further
OL,18,Frain arrives later Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
